  "description": "MCPInvoke is a lightweight .NET library that provides an execution endpoint for Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools. It works in conjunction with MCPBuckle (for discovery) to enable AI agent interaction with your ASP.NET Core APIs. Version 1.2.0 updates to use MCPBuckle 1.5.0 for improved schema generation, enhanced parameter binding, and better support for complex types.",
